{"id":"654997","name":"梅干菜水煎包","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/654997/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5g"},{"name":"糖","amount":"10g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"260g"}],"sub":[{"name":"梅干菜","amount":"1把"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱粒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉、酵母粉、糖。","img":"images/654997/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入适量的温水和成面团。","img":"images/654997/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"常温发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/654997/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡好的梅干菜切碎。","img":"images/654997/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"梅花肉。","img":"images/654997/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"切成肉丝。","img":"images/654997/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"姜葱粒适量。","img":"images/654997/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"不放油，梅菜炒干水分，盛出备用。","img":"images/654997/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热油倒入肉丝。","img":"images/654997/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"肉丝炒至干香，放入姜葱粒。","img":"images/654997/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入所有调料。","img":"images/654997/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入梅干菜翻炒入味。","img":"images/654997/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入适量的水，焖10分钟。","img":"images/654997/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"水分收干，铲出装盘放凉。","img":"images/654997/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"取出面团，揉搓排气，搓成长条，切成小面剂。","img":"images/654997/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"面剂压扁，擀成面皮。","img":"images/654997/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/654997/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"包子依次做完，二次发酵15分钟。","img":"images/654997/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"平底锅刷油，放入包子。","img":"images/654997/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"小火煎至底部金黄。","img":"images/654997/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"加入浸过包子2/3的水，中火煮7分钟，焖5分钟再开盖。","img":"images/654997/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"时间到。","img":"images/654997/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"翻开底部，个个金黄焦香。","img":"images/654997/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/654997/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"蓬松宣软，一口气能干3个。","img":"images/654997/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}